<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-05T02:38:37.213Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 02:38:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed Naga militants continue to clash in Manipur's Noney district, killing fighters and seizing weapons, while a military vehicle fell into a gorge in Ladakh, killing two army personnel. The Manipur chief minister warned insurgent groups of UAPA action and ordered reports on groups linked to the attacks. Security measures were heightened on the Northern Railway at Jammu stations ahead of upcoming festivals. A security panel on Manipur violence received a sixth extension, moving its deadline to May 2027, and an army commander reviewed security in Reasi. The conflict produced 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Scroll.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Excelsior&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBEY0dwT0J1a0FvNFdzOVA3cm40TXAzakJyVmRsQ21reEVfLS1icWZBa2ctUFdMV25kczlpWWl6Sk5iczQ2LU5OMGRZT3JRalpudWM0WF9hVU9HbHpmWWVKZjB1XzB6bHFaNHBKME1Ic3pleUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPRUR2dXY1VmJVUUNfZVpaTVhXQXR4SnRSSm5PcmdwVWg2WVBFbGFWS3ltR0hBem03Si16LUlxUWxXVUc0QVlLUFhjVlFUN0N0YTBuQkJCZ3lYMTVJcUp6OHFCWlVNUlhJM0drM21tWE1GRmRBYjktaEZXTno4RjdlLWhWWWo2WmI5NWlvV0dzX1BvTzBuMDBBR0RiWWJDU0hm?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &l